[9.14,"o","     Read with                 Cost a year, this repo   Compared with the best option\r\n"]
[9.2,"o","  1  Jev + Vercel AI Gateway   ≈ $0.055                 the best option\r\n"]
[9.26,"o","  2  Vercel AI Gateway         ≈ $0.11                  ≈ 93% of its breaking-change flags\r\n"]
